      "name": "Room Enough for All",
      "devanagari": "असंबाधं मध्यतो मानवानां यस्या उद्वतः प्रवतः समं बहु ।\nनानावीर्या ओषधीर्या बिभर्ति पृथिवी नः प्रथतां राध्यतां नः",
      "transliteration": "asaṁbādhaṁ madhyato mānavānāṁ yasyā udvataḥ pravataḥ samaṁ bahu\nnānāvīryā oṣadhīryā bibharti pṛthivī naḥ prathatāṁ rādhyatāṁ naḥ",
      "translation": "Free of crowding in the midst of humankind, she whose slopes and inclines and level plains are many, who bears plants of countless powers — may the Earth spread wide for us, may she prosper us."
