      "ref": "12.1.17",
      "name": "Mother of the Herbs",
      "devanagari": "विश्वस्वं मातरमोषधीनां ध्रुवां भूमिं पृथिवीं धर्मणा धृताम् ।\nशिवां स्योनामनु चरेम विश्वहा",
      "transliteration": "viśvasvaṁ mātaramoṣadhīnāṁ dhruvāṁ bhūmiṁ pṛthivīṁ dharmaṇā dhṛtām\nśivāṁ syonāmanu carema viśvahā",
      "translation": "The all-producing mother of the plants, the steadfast Earth held firm by cosmic law, the gracious, the kindly one — over her may we walk all our days."
